    "principles": [
      "B27 consumes B23-B26 and B15-B22 runtime evidence; it does not invent acceptance.",
      "Static validation describes a release and handoff contract but cannot approve traffic or production.",
      "Every runtime artifact is externally captured and bound to runId, sourceRevision, environment and audit references.",
      "A rollback is owner-local, idempotent, audited and reconciled across database and event facts; no two-phase commit or cross-service table write is allowed."
    ]
  },
